  };
```

`hasDefaultExport` can be inferred from the above return, so I think there's no value in pre-computing something that may never be used.

[lib/internal/test_runner/mock/mock.js] This code is ~90% redundant. I think you can DRY it up

```suggestion
  if (warnedLegacyOptions[option]) return;
