[lib/net.js] When getTOS() is called and the handle exists but doesn't support getTOS, the method returns the cached kSetTOS value which could be undefined. This creates inconsistent behavior compared to line 683 where undefined is explicitly converted to 0. The return should be: `return this[kSetTOS] !== undefined ? this[kSetTOS] : 0;`
```suggestion
    // Return cached value if set, otherwise default to 0
    return this[kSetTOS] !== undefined ? this[kSetTOS] : 0;
